// M6 backend CPU verification case.
//
// n     number of indices the parallel backend sweeps
// mode  square     -> out[i] = i*i                     (sum = (n-1)n(2n-1)/6)
//       divide     -> out[i] = (i+1)/2 (GradDivide style; sum = n(n+1)/4)
//
// The checker restates both closed forms independently and requires the
// active backend, the serial reference and the closed form to agree bit for
// bit. Probe cases mutate n / mode to exercise the parse-time refusals.
n    100000;
mode square;
